   "text": {
    "header": "Skip to content Home About Services Portfolio Skills Certifications Blog Contact Log in Courses All courses Courses and upcoming live classes Master Classes 3-hour live deep dives Google Ads Search and Demand Gen lead campaigns Meta Ads Lead and engagement campaigns Claude and Claude Code Prompting, building and automation Let's Connect Courses",
    "content": "Live on Google Meet Courses and Live Classes Learn performance marketing and AI automation from someone who does this work every day. Taught under The Digital School . Join an upcoming live class on Google Meet, try a 3-hour master class, or browse every course and see exactly what it covers. Upcoming classes All courses Upcoming classes New or returning? One Google sign-in covers both. Log in All times in IST (India Standard Time) 1 Pick a class Browse upcoming sessions and see what each one covers. 2 Continue with Google One Google sign-in covers signing up and logging in. Add your mobile number once; after that, enrolling is one tap. 3 Attend on Google Meet The green Join class button on My Classes opens 15 minutes before the class starts. No upcoming classes right now New dates are announced regularly. Message on WhatsApp to be told when the next class is scheduled. Notify me on WhatsApp All courses Every course comes from what is actually running campaigns, tracking conversions and building sites right now. Google Ads Search and Demand Gen lead generation campaigns, tracking and reporting, in 18 live classes 18 Live Classes View Curriculum No class scheduled yet Ask about the next class Meta Ads (Facebook & Instagram) Lead and engagement campaigns, creative and tracking, in 14 live classes 14 Live Classes View Curriculum No class scheduled yet Ask about the next class Claude and Claude Code From first prompts to building websites, tools and automations with Claude Code, in 12 live classes 12 Live Classes View Curriculum No class scheduled yet Ask about the next class Master Classes 3-hour live deep dives: one skill from start to finish, hands-on, on Google Meet 3-hour sessions View Master Classes No class scheduled yet Ask about the next class Interested in learning performance marketing from real-world experience? Need a topic that isn't listed? Tell me what you want to learn and it may become a future class. Suggest a topic WhatsApp Me Call Now Almost there One last step: add your mobile number so I can reach you about this class. You only do this once. Not you? Mobile number * Add number & enrol",
    "footer": "Performance Marketing Expert & SEO Specialist driving measurable growth through data-driven strategy. Quick Links Home About Services Portfolio Skills Certifications Courses Blog Contact Connect LinkedIn Instagram Contact +91 70001 98366 WhatsApp shashwatyadav012345@gmail.com © 2026 Shashwat Yadav. All rights reserved. | Privacy Policy | Terms Courses",
